WEBVTT

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:15.010
My First School Festival

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:12.610
Move that table a little more to the left.

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:16.620
Daniel, that tea set's expensive. 
Be careful with it.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:19.370
You shouldn't be using expensive 
stuff at a school festival.

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:22.660
I feel like I ought to 
return some of the wealth

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:25.010
I squeezed out of those idiot students.

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:28.600
You should be a little more conscious 
of how much everyone hates you.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.630
U-Uh...

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:35.890
I don't look strange, do I?

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:39.510
I'm not used to wearing outfits like this.

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:42.390
No, it looks perfect on you.

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:43.890
Hmm...

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:47.060
This emphasizes my bust a little too much.

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:52.330
Angie, you seem comfortable in that, 
even though you're a duke's daughter.

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:56.450
I spent two years at the 
royal palace, learning manners.

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:02.540
You look good, Livia. The innocent 
air it gives you is fantastic.

00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:05.380
I actually kind of like it, too.

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:09.690
What a precious sight.

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:12.730
But according to this otome game's setting,

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:15.210
I can't have romantic 
relationships with them.

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:18.130
I'm a mob character, after all.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.390
<b>Trapped in</b>

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:28.730
<b>a Dating Sim</b>

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:33.360
<b>Trapped in
a Dating Sim</b>

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:52.280
You have such pretty hair, Livia.

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:57.780
I wish I had a nice body like yours, Angie.

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:00.750
Do these girls really go to this academy?

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:02.910
I feel like I'm dreaming.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:03.910
Leon!

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.660
Listen to this!

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:10.280
What do you want? You're getting 
in the way. Could you leave?

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:13.540
You shouldn't speak to your sister like that.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:18.240
That's right. You should be 
consoling me and serving me tea.

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:22.120
Ah, yes. This is what girls at 
this academy are normally like.

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:23.390
The dream has ended.

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:27.560
What is it? Spit it out already.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:30.810
I had a fight with a friend.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:33.710
I'm sure you were fighting 
over boys or something.

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:36.690
Yeah. He's a viscount's heir.

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:41.020
He's a prime piece of property 
who's about to become very wealthy.

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:43.320
And your friend stole him out from under you?

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:45.450
It's the other way around.

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:46.580
Huh?

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:52.190
My friend had her eye on him first, 
but I thought I'd try pursuing him, too.

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:55.340
Then you're in the wrong. We're done here.

00:03:55.340 --> 00:03:57.710
I want you to step in and settle the matter!

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.820
If you'd just threaten her a little, this would—

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:01.720
Y-You mustn't do that.

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:03.720
Shut up, scholarship student.

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:07.350
I'm not doing anything for you.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:09.100
And don't be mean to Olivia.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:12.150
You can be sure Angie won't stay 
silent if anything happens.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:16.860
He's right. You may be Leon's 
sister, but I'll show no mercy.

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:19.610
F-Fine.

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:22.020
You're a useless idiot.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:25.180
Mr. Leon...

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:29.370
Thank you for worrying about me.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.740
<i>She's as radiant as ever, but...</i>

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:35.260
S-Something terrible is happening, Leon!

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:36.970
In the tea room next door...

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:40.410
Prince Julius!

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:43.030
I hope you'll all come. 
You'll be most welcome.

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:43.490
Oh, yes!

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:44.670
I'll totally be there!

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:45.460
Me, too!

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:47.150
I'm gonna spend so much money!

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:47.760
Wha—

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:50.750
We hope you'll visit Café Princess.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:53.200
What?!

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:55.750
I can't believe he's 
opening a café next door.

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:57.520
How incredibly spiteful.

00:04:59.990 --> 00:05:03.970
Bartfort, I heard you're 
running a café, as well.

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:06.410
If you're interested, do stop by ours.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.660
You're welcome to visit.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.910
<i>He's annoying as hell!</i>

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:16.170
You charge 100 dia for tea and sweets?!

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.590
What? Is that too cheap?

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:21.300
Marie said this was the right price.

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:26.570
I... I don't have the courage to 
enter such an expensive place.

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:31.310
Yeah, that's normal. Just ignore their café.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:35.710
You seem awfully confident. 
But we won't lose this time.

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:44.660
Hey, why are you following me?

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:47.070
Because I'm true to myself.

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:49.200
I'm curious, so I thought I'd check it out.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:51.210
Come on, show me what you've got.

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:58.960
This place is a freaking host club!

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:02.790
Bartfort, huh? How ignoble of you 
to scout out the competition.

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:04.410
This isn't fair!

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:08.170
Just getting to see your frustrated 
face makes it all worthwhile.

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:11.350
We were right to follow Marie's suggestion.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:13.350
Her again?

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:15.890
This time, <i>we</i> will win.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:18.120
You'd better not run off just 
because you think you'll lose.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:20.600
What are we even competing for? 
This is a school festival!

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:23.600
Is this really a café?

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:27.670
The atmosphere feels more like a bar, 
and they're charging 100 dia for tea.

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:29.240
Of course we are.

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:29.240
Huh?

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:33.120
Julius and the rest of the boys are 
former heirs to distinguished families.

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:36.500
They're the ones serving our customers.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:39.430
You're always up to no good, aren't you?

00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:41.880
Are you going to interfere 
with my plans again?

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:47.900
Are you the princess your 
café's name refers to?

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:49.330
"Princess," huh?

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:52.140
I-I'm a princess at heart!

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:55.830
Marie, you'll always be our princess.

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:57.350
Thank you.

00:06:57.350 --> 00:07:02.150
On the other hand, you're incredibly 
rude for a background mob character.

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:05.030
I'm excited for the day of the festival.

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:07.400
I doubt your café will be very busy.

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:10.400
We'll do you the favor of 
using it as our break room.

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:14.910
And we <i>will</i> be paying, so you'd 
better serve some proper tea.

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:18.140
You don't have to tell me. When it 
comes to tea, I don't mess around.

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:20.270
I couldn't do that to my master.

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:21.760
Welcome!

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:22.980
We're putting on a play!

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:24.620
How about a haunted house?

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:26.310
It starts tomorrow!

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:29.170
All right. I need to do my part, too.

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:30.030
Where should we go next?

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:30.930
What should we do?

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:32.930
E-Excuse me...

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:32.070
Where should we go?

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:35.160
What do you want, scholarship student?

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:37.930
I-I'm promoting a café.

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:41.060
You mean Bartfort's café?

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:42.310
Y-Yes.

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:43.810
We'd never go there.

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:48.720
The fact that he likes you has 
gone to your head, hasn't it?

00:07:48.720 --> 00:07:49.570
Huh?

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:52.820
Get rid of that misconception 
right now, commoner.

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:54.820
B-But I...

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:58.700
Don't. The duke's daughter likes her.

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:03.460
Angering the Redgrave family could 
endanger your entire household.

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:04.310
Hmph.

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:10.210
You're running a café?

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:12.090
Y-Yes.

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:14.340
Very nice. That sounds fun.

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:18.600
I'm Carla. Carla Fou Wayne.

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:25.600
A school festival, huh?

00:08:26.090 --> 00:08:30.180
I'm looking forward to 
seeing you, Baron Bartfort.

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:33.360
All right.

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:37.240
Today's the first day. 
Show some spirit, boys!

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.620
Yeah!

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:43.880
Ladies, don't forget to take 
breaks and enjoy the festival.

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:45.250
You're so much nicer to them!

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:48.160
I-I'm starting to feel nervous.

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:51.140
This is my first time working in a café, too.

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:52.380
I've been looking forward to—

00:08:52.660 --> 00:08:56.120
Ms. Angelica, the executive committee 
would like to speak with you.

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:58.270
Please head to the committee 
headquarters immediately.

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:08.900
Your Majesty, I cannot accommodate 
such an unreasonable request.

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:15.530
I'm sorry, but I'd like you to tolerate 
my selfishness just for today.

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:18.970
I went through a lot of 
trouble for you, you know.

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:20.660
I'm sorry.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:24.410
And besides, this is my first school festival.

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:27.790
It's been a while since I last 
saw you in a maid uniform.

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:31.150
I-I appreciate everything 
you did for me back then.

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:38.830
<i>Lady Mylene is the queen of Holfort 
Kingdom and the prince's mother.</i>

00:09:39.690 --> 00:09:42.810
<i>I am forever indebted to her.</i>

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:47.440
I'm relieved to see you're 
looking better, though.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:50.940
Yes, I'm enjoying my time at the academy.

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:55.190
Oh? Is that because of Leon?

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:56.210
Huh?

00:09:58.600 --> 00:10:02.490
M-More importantly, do you really 
intend to meet with Leon?

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:04.020
Of course I do.

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:07.780
It's Julius's own fault he was disinherited,

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:10.580
but as his mother, I'd like 
to have a word with Leon.

00:10:10.890 --> 00:10:14.210
B-But I'm responsible for 
what happened, as well.

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:17.840
No, it's what happened during the 
duel that I'm not happy about.

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:21.410
As his mother, let me apologize 
for my son's actions.

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:23.660
I'm sorry, Angie.

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:24.970
You don't need to apologize.

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:28.850
But I can't believe Julius was fooled so easily.

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:33.130
The academy is even worse than I thought.

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:35.390
What? You're charging money for this?

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:36.890
This should be free.

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:38.610
P-Please...

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:41.960
What an awful place.

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:44.290
I'm so excited!

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:45.120
I can't wait!

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.020
I'm having five cups of tea.

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:48.620
I'm going to ask for Lord Brad.

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:51.070
Mr. Leon, there's a line.

00:10:51.070 --> 00:10:53.250
They're so damn shameless.

00:10:56.690 --> 00:10:59.530
I'm here as a customer. Show me to a seat.

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.760
It's time to cause trouble for Leon.

00:11:05.070 --> 00:11:06.840
Angie, I expect your help.

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:09.620
But I work here.

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:11.500
Oh, come on.

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:14.240
I'll just complain about the tea 
being lukewarm or something.

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:16.290
I'll have him remake it at least three ti—

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:17.890
This tea is lukewarm!

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:20.400
Make me a new cup!

00:11:24.430 --> 00:11:25.650
Mr. Leon!

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:30.660
I'm sorry. I'll make you 
a new cup right away.

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:37.670
Actually, never mind. I doubt your 
tea leaves are very good anyway.

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:42.720
I don't have to pay for 
such disgusting tea, do I?

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:45.370
If anything, shouldn't you be paying me?

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:47.930
I expect you to pay for your tea.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.020
What?

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:53.190
How much money do you think you cheated 
everyone out of by betting on your own duel?

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:55.310
Some girls had to sell their slaves!

00:11:55.850 --> 00:11:58.820
Wh-What's going on here?

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:03.200
Say something, you scumbag!

00:12:06.440 --> 00:12:07.700
Angie...

00:12:10.270 --> 00:12:12.830
What a dreadful attitude.

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:15.010
I'd like you to leave.

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:20.500
Well, if it isn't Angelica, 
the girl the prince cast aside.

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:21.870
Why are you dressed like that?

00:12:21.870 --> 00:12:24.720
Aren't you embarrassed as 
the daughter of a nobleman?

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:28.020
<i>She's Count Offrey's daughter.</i>

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:30.470
<i>They're a rival family.</i>

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:33.090
Did you think I'd be scared of you?

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:34.980
Who'd be scared of a waning 
noblewoman like you?

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:36.230
Please stop!

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:37.800
Livia...

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:40.730
How could you be so cruel 
to Mr. Leon and Angie?

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:42.740
Please leave!

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:46.740
What? Don't push your luck, commoner.

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:51.250
You think you can stand 
on equal footing with us?

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:54.750
Just because you're 
Angelica's cute little pet?

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:56.830
Her pet?

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:00.500
That's enough, wench. You'll pay for this.

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:04.260
Are you cozying up to commoners 
now because you've lost friends?

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:10.140
Don't you remember saying 
commoners are just numbers?

00:13:12.010 --> 00:13:13.800
You did? But...

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:15.890
No, I...

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:18.450
Commoners aren't people.

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:22.400
Just because you know a slightly accomplished 
scumbag knight and a duke's daughter—

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.900
Shut your stinking mouth.

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:28.910
What? Don't get ahead of yourself, shithead.

00:13:29.230 --> 00:13:32.290
Do you know what it means to make 
an enemy of a count's family?

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:38.670
That's enough.

00:13:40.680 --> 00:13:41.920
What do you want, you old hag?

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.400
O-Old?

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:47.420
I-I'm going to pretend I didn't hear that.

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:50.850
Pay for your tea and leave this place.

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:53.430
Aren't you ashamed of yourselves 
as nobles of the kingdom?

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:56.780
What? Who do you think I am?

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:58.690
I'm the Offrey family's daughter.

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:01.190
Someone throw this hag out of here.

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:04.790
That's enough. Who do you think you're...

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:12.700
C-Calm down, Leon.

00:14:14.110 --> 00:14:15.450
<i>Now...</i>

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:19.080
<i>I have a cause!</i>

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:25.460
Take this, idiot!

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:27.470
You're the idiot!

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:31.670
Laying a hand on a servant will make 
all the girls at the academy hate you.

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:37.850
Time for a delightful party.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:40.850
Now die!

00:14:41.170 --> 00:14:42.780
Leon!

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:44.360
He's lost his mind!

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:51.240
You can't be serious! 
How dare you strike my servants?!

00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:57.000
Check yourselves, you swine. Do you 
have any idea who this woman is?

00:14:57.690 --> 00:14:59.790
She is the queen of Holfort Kingdom...

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:03.240
Her Majesty, Queen Mylene!

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:11.490
Prepare yourself.

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:16.360
Your father may be a count, but you won't 
get away with picking a fight with a queen.

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:18.940
Leon, wait. I'm traveling incognito.

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:21.020
Be a good boy and calm down, okay?

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:25.270
Your Majesty, allow me, 
Leon Fou Bartfort, to handle this.

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:28.530
Annihilate or exterminate, I'm your man.

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:31.280
I'll kill. Them. All.

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:34.410
I told you, we can't do that!

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.130
Please stop!

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.130
<i>He's out of control.</i>

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:40.160
<i>There's only one man who can help us now.</i>

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:48.040
Mr. Leon, one who follows the path 
of tea mustn't trouble ladies.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:50.380
It's ungentlemanly.

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:53.680
I'm sorry, Master, but I...

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:57.260
I know it was difficult.
I know it was painful for you.

00:15:57.700 --> 00:16:03.550
But beyond such challenges lie true 
gentlemanhood and the path of tea.

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:05.560
Y-Yes, Master!

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:09.530
Allow me to prepare some tea for you.

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:14.840
<i>The master's tea! Oh, happy tea time!</i>

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:15.570
Leon.

00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:18.200
I am angry.

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:22.710
P-Please spare my family!

00:16:23.050 --> 00:16:25.460
I don't care what happens to me.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:29.140
What? N-No, no! That's not what I meant!

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:30.680
Angie, help!

00:16:30.680 --> 00:16:33.340
Lady Mylene, he's making fun of you.

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:34.340
Huh?

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:37.740
You're awful! I misjudged you!

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:40.260
I am very sorry.

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:45.480
Leon, I came here to voice my complaints.

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:49.480
Not regarding your punishment, 
but as a personal matter.

00:16:50.740 --> 00:16:52.490
I'm listening.

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:58.300
I apologize for Julius's actions, 
but the duel itself was unacceptable.

00:16:58.300 --> 00:17:00.350
The way you fought was awful.

00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:06.370
Couldn't you have settled 
the manner peacefully?

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:10.380
<i>I just noticed something incredible.</i>

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:17.780
By Leon Fou Bartfort
Noblewoman Enjoying Tea

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:16.590
<i>She's super pretty. She doesn't 
look like someone in their thirties.</i>

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:20.390
You have many enemies at the royal palace.

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:23.640
Have you given thought to your future?

00:17:23.880 --> 00:17:25.140
Of course.

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:30.430
I see. If you're certain, 
then I have nothing more to say.

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:33.770
I'd like you to help me with something else.

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:35.030
What do you mean?

00:17:35.510 --> 00:17:41.030
Since I came from a neighboring country, 
I never attended the academy.

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:46.540
So I'd like to create some memories here.

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:51.130
<i>In my previous life, I might've 
told this hag to do it herself.</i>

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.530
<i>But I'm different now.</i>

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:56.800
Very well. Let us create memories 
at the academy together.

00:17:57.310 --> 00:18:00.130
Lady Mylene, will you marry me?

00:18:00.130 --> 00:18:02.810
Huh? What?!

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:05.550
Mr. Leon, what are you saying?!

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:07.060
She's the queen!

00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:10.050
<i>I know. I know, but...</i>

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:16.910
<i>A cute, ladylike woman in her thirties is far 
better than the feral teens of the academy!</i>

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:20.320
<i>I want to marry a human, so...</i>

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:23.410
I love you. I adore you.

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:29.040
B-But I have a husband and children.

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:33.290
Besides, I'm an old woman.

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:36.120
It doesn't matter. You're beautiful.

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:38.300
Even if you have a family, I—

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:42.100
That hurt! Who did that?

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:46.180
Oh, Your Highness.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:52.190
Bartfort, you've got some nerve 
wooing a man's mother like that.

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:55.190
Th-This isn't what it looks like, Julius.

00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:59.220
Mother, get away from that man.

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:00.940
Let go of her.

00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:03.950
What? But I don't wanna.

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:06.950
Leon!

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:09.460
Ignore him. Let's go, Mother.

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:11.620
Well, he got what he deserved.

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:13.450
I agree.

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:19.210
Your Majesty, were you able to create 
the memories you wanted at the academy?

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:26.100
Mother, you mustn't allow Bartfort near you.

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:29.480
He's a rude, greedy coward.

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:37.730
Julius, didn't you say you and 
your friends were running a café?

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:41.930
Yes, although Marie made some adjustments.

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:43.770
Isn't it marvelous?

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:46.260
Bring her to me.

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:49.310
<i>Sh-She's super pissed.</i>

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:55.100
<i>If she finds out I've been making 
her son, the prince, serve girls...</i>

00:19:56.510 --> 00:19:59.100
Mother, you're just like the others.

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:01.880
If that's the attitude you're taking, 
I can't allow you to see Marie.

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:08.290
Didn't you call Leon greedy?

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:11.140
Then what are this store's prices?

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:14.380
You're charging 100 dia for 
low-quality sweets and tea?

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:16.770
And a service fee on top of that?

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:21.020
And what are the former heirs to 
distinguished families doing dressed like that?

00:20:21.020 --> 00:20:22.420
I-I...

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:27.990
You agreed to stay away from 
Marie after losing the duel.

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:30.650
Who's the promise-breaking coward?

00:20:31.090 --> 00:20:35.920
I'm just helping Brad and the others 
who happen to be with Marie.

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:38.130
Don't make disgraceful excuses.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:41.920
In any case, bring that girl to me.

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:48.550
But she was totally my type.

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:53.430
You fool. What kind of knight 
makes advances on his own queen?

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:56.590
<i>Now that I think about it, though,</i>

00:20:56.590 --> 00:21:00.550
<i>there's no way a mob character 
like me could marry a queen.</i>

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:02.940
Excuse me.

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:04.820
Are you still open?

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:09.280
I'm sorry. My spirit's been 
broken, so we're closed.

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.580
Why, you...

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:13.830
What? Um, in that case...

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:16.080
Oh, Ms. Olivia.

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:18.890
Could you do that thing 
I asked you about before?

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:20.340
Y-Yes.

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:25.830
This is Ms. Carla. She asked me 
to introduce her to you, Mr. Leon.

00:21:26.730 --> 00:21:29.000
I am Carla Fou Wayne.

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:32.100
Nice to meet you, my lord.

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:34.600
<i>Carla Wayne?</i>

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:38.980
So, why'd you ask Livia for an introduction?

00:21:44.060 --> 00:21:47.490
My lord, please save the Wayne family.

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:50.230
Please save us.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:57.670
<b>Trapped in a Dating Sim</b>

00:23:25.810 --> 00:23:27.840
I bet I'd get girls if I rode an air bike.

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:28.990
Not true.

00:23:28.990 --> 00:23:32.050
Question! What do you need 
when looking for a wife?

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:32.670
Money.

00:23:32.670 --> 00:23:33.050
Good looks.

00:23:33.050 --> 00:23:33.740
Status.

00:23:33.740 --> 00:23:34.510
A distinguished pedigree.

00:23:34.510 --> 00:23:35.050
The ability to provide.

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:35.680
Knowing when to give up.

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:36.560
Wisdom.

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:38.410
Next time: "I Hate Other Hot Guys."
